      "value": "<h2><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  80 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong>  None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>  20 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong>  Omni</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A ball of hyper condensed Ki is crushed into dust and thrown at a high velocity at an opponent. Roll an <em>Omni Attack Roll</em> dealing damage on a hit based on the target's <em>Alignment</em>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Evil: 30d6 <em>Ki Damage</em></li>\n<li>Neutral: 20d6 <em>Ki Damage</em></li>\n<li>Good: 10d6 <em>Ki Damage</em></li>\n</ul>\n",
